  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven broiler to High (500°F / 260°C) for 3 minutes. Line a baking sheet with foil.",
    "Place the peaches cut-side up on the prepared baking sheet. Dust evenly with the cinnamon.",
    "Broil for 5 to 7 minutes, checking at 5 minutes, until the fruit is tender and the edges are lightly golden.",
    "Whisk the ricotta cheese and vanilla extract in a bowl until smooth and creamy.",
    "Toast the sliced almonds in a dry skillet over medium heat for 2 to 3 minutes, shaking the pan frequently, until lightly browned and fragrant.",
    "Divide the warm peaches between serving plates. Top each half with the vanilla ricotta, maple syrup, and toasted almonds."
